    "text": "If $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}(3 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+\\hat{\\mathrm{k}})$ and $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{b}}=\\frac{1}{7}(2 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+3 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}-6 \\hat{\\mathrm{k}})$, then the value of $(2 \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}-\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{b}}) \\cdot[(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}} \\times \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{b}}) \\times(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}+2 \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{b}})]$ is"
